n that's urgently required woke  warriors want health professionals to  ease off on the global fat fight because  you guessed it it's racist  the university of illinois chicago  school of public health says weight  stigma is discrimination or stereotyping  based on a person's weight and is one of  the last types of discrimination still  condoned and carried out by public  health and medical experts this report  says focus on body size is rooted in  racism dating back to charles darwin and  the stigmatizing words like obesity  should be dropped for terms like people  in larger bodies  for the love of god  the people being lectured about all this  are doctors highly educated medical  professionals they should be allowed to  get on with their jobs without worrying  about upsetting people who need to lose  weight and by the way here's a pro tip  if you do want to lose weight and take  it from me someone is carrying a bit of  excess timber the way to do it is to do  a bit more exercise and stick with  little less food and alcohol down your  gullet that normally tends to work the  idea is now deemed racist to criticize  morbid obesity is yet another symptom of  the woke virus is grip on common sense  we now know the higher mortality rates  from covert 19 in the black community  were linked to obesity when we tell the  medics who are mobilized in the fight on  fact to stand down because it's racist  we're actually putting our minority  communities at greater risk of poor  health and death and that ironically is  racism  professional footballers are among the  most lavishly paid athletes in the world  top players can earn millions every  month for kicking a ball around which  obviously sounds ridiculous in an  economic crisis but their salaries are  driven by market force they get paid a  lot of money because they're the best of  what they do and they make a lot of  money for their teams and the same  simple economic calculation should apply  to men and women that's why i'm